    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented is this delightful 2 bedroom ground floor corner apartment boasting its own front door and extending to approximately 58 square meters. The south facing accommodation overlooks the mature communal gardens and offers bright and spacious living throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an open plan, light-filled living and dining room, a separate kitchen, two generous double bedrooms and a family bathroom. Finished with oak laminated flooring, double glazed windows and ATC electric heating, the apartment offers comfortable and modern living.\r\n\r\nOutside, there is ample communal parking and beautifully maintained mature communal gardens to enjoy.\r\n\r\nIdeally located just off Turvey Avenue, the development is a stone's throw from Newbridge Park and just a 5 to 10 minute walk from Donabate train station and village, offering excellent convenience for commuters and easy access to a host of local amenities.\r\n\r\nManagement fees are approximately €1,500 per year."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: \r\nAlarm panel, laminated floor, hot press. \r\n\r\nLounge: 19' * 13' 9\"\r\nLaminated floor, cove ceiling, bay window, electric fireplace, TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 6' 8\" * 5' 9\"\r\nWall and floor mounted kitchen units, oven, microwave, hob, extractor fan, fridge/freezer, tiled backsplash. \r\n\r\nBedroom one: 10' 9* 9' 2\"\r\nLaminated floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom two: 10' 6 * 9' 2\" \r\nLaminated floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBathroom: 6' 2\" * 5' 4\"\r\nWC, WHB, walk-in shower, tiled floor, tiled walls, window, extractor fan. \r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nCommunal gardens, ample parking, bin and storage shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ground floor apartment\r\nD/G windows\r\nATC electric heating\r\nElectric fireplace\r\nRenovated kitchen\r\nRenovated bathroom\r\nLarge living room area\r\nParking\r\nManagement fee €1500 per year\r\n10 min walk to the train station and village\r\n5 min walk to the Newbridge Park"
      },
      {
